  "text": "Verification of tenant-scoped repository implementation:\n\nKey findings:\n1. New tenant-scoped methods are properly implemented with AND tenant_id filtering\n2. All request-path callers in auth.rs, oauth.rs, nostr_rpc.rs verified updated\n3. validate_domain correctly rejects unknown domains when neither ALLOWED_TENANT_DOMAINS nor ENABLE_TENANT_AUTO_PROVISIONING is set\n4. Tests for cross-tenant isolation exist for oauth_authorization\n5. .env.example properly updated with both config options\n6. Startup warnings added to main.rs\n\nISSUE: No cross-tenant isolation test for personal_keys.rs repository\n- The commit added delete_by_user_for_tenant with tenant_id filtering (good)\n- But no test was added to verify the tenant isolation works\n- oauth_authorization has test_find_by_bunker_pubkey_for_tenant_isolates_tenants\n- personal_keys should have similar test like test_find_encrypted_key_for_tenant_isolates_tenants\n- This is a gap in test coverage for the spec requirement",
